    "Fast, modern and advanced photo management suite" : "Hurtig, moderne og avanceret billedhåndtering",
    "# Memories: Photo Management for Nextcloud\n\nMemories is a *batteries-included* photo management solution for Nextcloud with advanced features including:\n\n- **📸 Timeline**: Sort photos and videos by date taken, parsed from Exif data.\n- **⏪ Rewind**: Jump to any time in the past instantly and relive your memories.\n- **🤖 AI Tagging**: Group photos by people and objects, powered by [recognize](https://github.com/nextcloud/recognize) and [facerecognition](https://github.com/matiasdelellis/facerecognition).\n- **🖼️ Albums**: Create albums to group photos and videos together. Then share these albums with others.\n- **🫱🏻‍🫲🏻 External Sharing**: Share photos and videos with people outside of your Nextcloud instance.\n- **📱 Mobile Support**: Work from any device, of any shape and size through the web app.\n- **✏️ Edit Metadata**: Edit dates and other metadata on photos quickly and in bulk.\n- **📦 Archive**: Store photos you don't want to see in your timeline in a separate folder.\n- **📹 Video Transcoding**: Transcode videos and use HLS for maximal performance.\n- **🗺️ Map**: View your photos on a map, tagged with accurate reverse geocoding.\n- **📦 Migration**: Migrate easily from Nextcloud Photos and Google Takeout.\n- **⚡️ Performance**: Do all this very fast.\n\n## 🚀 Installation\n\n1. Install the app from the Nextcloud app store (try a demo [here](https://demo.memories.gallery/apps/memories/)).\n1. Perform the recommended [configuration steps](https://memories.gallery/config/).\n1. Run `php occ memories:index` to generate metadata indices for existing photos.\n1. Open the 📷 Memories app in Nextcloud and set the directory containing your photos." : "# Memories: Billedhåndtering til Nextcloud\n\nMemories er en komplet løsning til billedhåndtering i Nextcloud med avancerede funktioner, bl.a.:\n\n- **📸 Tidslinje**: Sortér billeder og videoer efter optagelsesdato, læst fra Exif-data.\n- **⏪ Spol tilbage**: Spring med det samme til et hvilket som helst tidspunkt i fortiden, og genoplev dine minder.\n- **🤖 AI-mærkning**: Gruppér billeder efter personer og objekter med [recognize](https://github.com/nextcloud/recognize) og [facerecognition](https://github.com/matiasdelellis/facerecognition).\n- **🖼️ Album**: Opret album, der samler billeder og videoer. Del derefter albummene med andre.\n- **🫱🏻‍🫲🏻 Ekstern deling**: Del billeder og videoer med personer uden for din Nextcloud-instans.\n- **📱 Mobilunderstøttelse**: Arbejd fra enhver enhed, uanset form og størrelse, via webappen.\n- **✏️ Rediger metadata**: Rediger datoer og andre metadata på billeder hurtigt og mange ad gangen.\n- **📦 Arkiv**: Gem billeder, du ikke vil se på tidslinjen, i en separat mappe.\n- **📹 Videotranskodning**: Transkod videoer, og brug HLS for at få den bedste ydeevne.\n- **🗺️ Kort**: Se dine billeder på et kort, mærket med præcis omvendt geokodning.\n- **📦 Migrering**: Migrer nemt fra Nextcloud Photos og Google Takeout.\n- **⚡️ Ydeevne**: Gør alt dette meget hurtigt.\n\n## 🚀 Installation\n\n1. Installer appen fra Nextclouds app store (prøv en demo [her](https://demo.memories.gallery/apps/memories/)).\n1. Udfør de anbefalede [konfigurationstrin](https://memories.gallery/config/).\n1. Kør `php occ memories:index` for at oprette metadataindekser for eksisterende billeder.\n1. Åbn appen 📷 Memories i Nextcloud, og angiv mappen med dine billeder.",
